:expect-pins 7
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-38.

# The active lease must rejoin the exact injury-victim witness.
? correct(Case_Adam, ActivePower).
# => FALSE

# The compact case record does not currently certify the victim field.
? match(Adam, CaseRecorded).
# => TRUE

# The substantive conviction record requires both InjuryVictimScope witnesses.
? match(Adam, ConvictionRecorded).
# => FALSE

# The custody gate fails closed without the exact victim witness.
? prisoner(Adam).
# => FALSE

# The missing victim evidence cannot become a withholding gate on liberty.
? travel(Adam).
# => TRUE

# The raw inactive lease derives a lease-scoped record error.
? err(Case_Adam, TemporalRecord).
# => TRUE

# The incomplete conviction basis separately derives a person-facing authority error.
? err(Adam, TemporalAuthority).
# => TRUE
